WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:05.600
Every NH-1 has a number.
This one is 0427.

00:00:06.600 --> 00:00:09.790
Before there was glass,
there was a line on paper.

00:00:12.500 --> 00:00:16.200
Nobody checks one in a hundred.
We check them all.

00:00:19.400 --> 00:00:23.900
0427 passed,
at 0.12 percent.

00:00:28.000 --> 00:00:30.350
By tomorrow,
it's at your door.

00:00:33.000 --> 00:00:35.230
Its whole story
comes in the box.

00:00:38.400 --> 00:00:41.050
It listens to the room,
then settles in.

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:49.570
At 42 Hz, your room hums.
Now it doesn't.

00:00:53.000 --> 00:00:54.980
Every disc keeps a record.

00:00:55.880 --> 00:00:58.750
So which record goes on first?
